  "details": "When I open up Vrchat on my PC in non-VR mode, the screen is entirely white, but I'm able to hear the sound of the login menu. From what I can hear, I am able to click on elements but I can't see them, therefore preventing me from logging in. I've tried everything from uninstalling and reinstalling, deleting temp files, checking my drivers, and ensuring my firewall doesn't block VRchat but nothing seems to be working. \n\nRecently Windows 11 has updated, so I have no idea if that's interfering with the app.",
